# Never put unreviewed user data into version control.
projects/local-*/
projects/**/private/
projects/**/inputs/
projects/**/sources/
projects/**/drafts/

# Files above are excluded by default, but reports/registries/checkpoints
# may also contain personal or sensitive information. Review every diff.
# A reviewed, public demo fixture can be explicitly tracked when approved.
